<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Coronation says in talks, issues cautionary.</title>
<headline>Coronation says in talks, issues cautionary.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-06-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Coronation Holdings Ltd said on Friday it was involved in talks which if successfully concluded could have an impact on its share price.</p>
<p>It urged shareholders to exercise caution when dealing in shares until a further announcement was made.</p>
<p>The company gave no further details in a brief statement.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
